}/* End custom CSS */</style>{"id":278,"slug":"shipping-and-payments","content":{"raw":"<img width=\"1920\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Shipping-Payments-Page-Banner.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Shipping-Payments-Page-Banner.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Shipping-Payments-Page-Banner-300x94.jpg 300w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Shipping-Payments-Page-Banner-1024x320.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Shipping-Payments-Page-Banner-1536x480.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Shipping-Payments-Page-Banner-600x188.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n    <h2>SHIPPING & PAYMENTS<\/h2>\n<style>\n.custom-title{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    gap:20px;\n}\n.custom-title h2{\n    margin:0;\n    font-family:\"Jost\", Sans-serif;\n    font-size:22px;\n    font-weight:300;\n    color:#222222;\n    line-height:1;\n}\n.custom-title span{\n    width:80px;\n    height:0.5px;\n    background:#6d6e71;\n    display:block;\n}\n\/* Mobile Responsive *\/\n@media(max-width:767px){\n.custom-title{\n    gap:10px;\n}\n.custom-title h2{\n    font-size:14px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.custom-title span{\n    width:40px;\n    height:0.25px;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>UAE SHIPPING<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Orders placed in the UAE before 1 PM will be delivered on the same day, while orders placed after 1 PM will be delivered on the next working\nday. For orders made on Saturdays after 1 PM, delivery will be on Monday. There will be no deliveries on weekends or holidays.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>INTERNATIONAL SHIPPING<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Enjoy the convenience of international shipping on all products from our online store. The shipping cost will be accurately calculated during\nthe final step of your checkout, and delivery typically takes 3 - 7 working days.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>DUTIES AND TAXES<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Please take note that certain countries outside the UAE may impose taxes, custom duties, or other fees on your purchases. The recipient will\nbe accountable for settling these payments, which will be facilitated by our shipping agent before the package is delivered.<br><br>\nWhen shipping internationally FIERRO adheres to the policy that any delays in deliveries due to import issues are beyond our control and\nresponsibility. If a delivery is refused, the customer will be responsible for all charges incurred, including the return cost of the package if\napplicable to FIERRO. \n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>ORDER TRACKING<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>A tracking number will be sent to your registered email, simply click the tracking number to track your shipment on the shipping agents website<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>AMMENDING (ADDING OR REMOVING) AN EXISITING ORDER<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Contact Customer Support <b>Contact Us<\/b> or Message us on <b>Whatsapp<\/b><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>CHANGE OF ADDRESS<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Should you require assistance with your order before it has been shipped, we are here to help. For address modifications of orders already\nin transit, we recommend reaching out directly to the courier for any address modification.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>CANCELLING AN ORDER<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Orders can only be canceled before they are fulfilled or shipped. If you need to cancel your order, please contact us as soon as possible. <\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>PAYMENT METHOD<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Credit\/Debit Card Payment<br>\nTabby<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>PAYMENT METHOD<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our team of FIERRO experts can help to answer any questions or concerns.<br><br>\n<b>Email<br>\nContact Us<br>\nWhatsapp<\/b><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\n        <h2>LETS SOCIALIZE <\/h2>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/fierrojewellery\/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Instagram-Icon.svg\" alt=\"Instagram\"><\/a>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/profile.php?id=61592874454475\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Facebook-Icon.svg\" alt=\"Facebook\"><\/a>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.tiktok.com\/@fierrojewellery\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/TikTok-Icon.svg\" alt=\"TitTok\"><\/a>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/971527794759\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Icon.svg\" alt=\"WhatsApp\"><\/a>\n<style>\n    .social-icons {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n}\n.social-icons a img {\n    width: 35px;\n    height: 35px;\n    display: block;\n    transition-duration: .1s;\n}\n.social-icons a img:hover{\n    scale: .9;\n    transition-duration: .1s;\n}\n .bsh-heading-social .bsh-text-col-social{\n        display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 13px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.bsh-heading-social {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 25px!important;\n}\n .bsh-heading-social .bsh-line {\n    width: 75px!important;\n    height: 1px;\n    background-color: #6D6E71;\n    justify-self: center;\n}\n.bsh-heading-social .bsh-text-col {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 5px!important;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n .bsh-heading-social .bsh-title {\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    color: #222222;\n    margin: 0;\n    line-height: 1;\n}\n.bsh-heading-social .bsh-subtitle{\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #6d6e71;\n}\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .bsh-heading-social .bsh-title {\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .social-icons a img {\n        width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    display: block;\n    transition-duration: .1s; \n    }\n    .social-icons a img {\n        width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    display: block;\n    transition-duration: .1s; \n    }\n    .social-icons {\n        gap: 10px;\n    }\n    .bsh-heading-social .bsh-line {\n    width: 35px!important;\n    height: 0.25;\n    background-color: #6D6E71;\n    justify-self: center;\n}\n    .bsh-heading-social .bsh-text-col-social{\n        display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 5px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n}\n}\n<\/style>","rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"278\" class=\"elementor elementor-278\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-77863a3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"77863a3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-54495f7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"54495f7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Shipping-Payments-Page-Banner.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-302\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Shipping-Payments-Page-Banner.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Shipping-Payments-Page-Banner-300x94.jpg 300w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Shipping-Payments-Page-Banner-1024x320.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Shipping-Payments-Page-Banner-1536x480.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Shipping-Payments-Page-Banner-600x188.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9f782e4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9f782e4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d08212a elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"d08212a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"custom-title\">\r\n    <span><\/span>\r\n    <h2>SHIPPING & PAYMENTS<\/h2>\r\n    <span><\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n.custom-title{\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    justify-content:center;\r\n    gap:20px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.custom-title h2{\r\n    margin:0;\r\n    font-family:\"Jost\", Sans-serif;\r\n    font-size:22px;\r\n    font-weight:300;\r\n    color:#222222;\r\n    line-height:1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.custom-title span{\r\n    width:80px;\r\n    height:0.5px;\r\n    background:#6d6e71;\r\n    display:block;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* Mobile Responsive *\/\r\n@media(max-width:767px){\r\n\r\n.custom-title{\r\n    gap:10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.custom-title h2{\r\n    font-size:14px;\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.custom-title span{\r\n    width:40px;\r\n    height:0.25px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n}\r\n<\/style>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8f62f8b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8f62f8b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">UAE SHIPPING<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a76512 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4a76512\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Orders placed in the UAE before 1 PM will be delivered on the same day, while orders placed after 1 PM will be delivered on the next working\nday. For orders made on Saturdays after 1 PM, delivery will be on Monday. There will be no deliveries on weekends or holidays.<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e23cd5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6e23cd5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">INTERNATIONAL SHIPPING<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9e3d5af elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9e3d5af\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Enjoy the convenience of international shipping on all products from our online store. The shipping cost will be accurately calculated during\nthe final step of your checkout, and delivery typically takes 3 - 7 working days.<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad0470f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ad0470f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">DUTIES AND TAXES<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c9ab497 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c9ab497\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Please take note that certain countries outside the UAE may impose taxes, custom duties, or other fees on your purchases. The recipient will\nbe accountable for settling these payments, which will be facilitated by our shipping agent before the package is delivered.<br><br>\nWhen shipping internationally FIERRO adheres to the policy that any delays in deliveries due to import issues are beyond our control and\nresponsibility. If a delivery is refused, the customer will be responsible for all charges incurred, including the return cost of the package if\napplicable to FIERRO. \n<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e9d6f7d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e9d6f7d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">ORDER TRACKING<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a95a07c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a95a07c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">A tracking number will be sent to your registered email, simply click the tracking number to track your shipment on the shipping agents website<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d59a43 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7d59a43\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">AMMENDING (ADDING OR REMOVING) AN EXISITING ORDER<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ebbb292 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ebbb292\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Contact Customer Support <b>Contact Us<\/b> or Message us on <b>Whatsapp<\/b><\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ddd474 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0ddd474\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">CHANGE OF ADDRESS<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1aa782f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1aa782f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Should you require assistance with your order before it has been shipped, we are here to help. For address modifications of orders already\nin transit, we recommend reaching out directly to the courier for any address modification.<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b1d9e06 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b1d9e06\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">CANCELLING AN ORDER<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6c2fda0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6c2fda0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Orders can only be canceled before they are fulfilled or shipped. If you need to cancel your order, please contact us as soon as possible. <\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6bb710d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6bb710d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">PAYMENT METHOD<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6dcfd23 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6dcfd23\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Credit\/Debit Card Payment<br>\nTabby<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-02a1f1b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"02a1f1b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">PAYMENT METHOD<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c927445 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c927445\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our team of FIERRO experts can help to answer any questions or concerns.<br><br>\n<b>Email<br>\nContact Us<br>\nWhatsapp<\/b><\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f290846 elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"f290846\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bsh-heading-social\" class=\"social\">\r\n    <span class=\"bsh-line\"><\/span>\r\n    <div class=\"bsh-text-col-social\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"bsh-title\">LETS SOCIALIZE <\/h2>\r\n        <div class=\"social-icons\">\r\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/fierrojewellery\/\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Instagram-Icon.svg\" alt=\"Instagram\"><\/a>\r\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/profile.php?id=61592874454475\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/